								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							By far it was POOJ. &nbsp;I still remeber him tell us that he could kill vs solo all becuse he had some clicky item and he was all that becuse of it. &nbsp;I think he wiped the entire zone like what 6 times or so. &nbsp;Ya he was a class act let me tell ya.<br /> &nbsp;Oh ya and ever mage and chanter to step foot in Bot to &quot;solo&quot; &nbsp;*cough *cough ks and train people for the uba ornate that the named hardly ever drop.
